\title{Protocol Snarkification}
\author{dhsorens}
\meta{toc}{true}
\date{2025-12-18}

\p{
    There are ongoing efforts to "snarkify" Ethereum, i.e. to integrate [zero knowledge proofs](dhsorens-001L) into every layer of the Ethereum protocol. I contribute to this via [formal verification](dhsorens-000X) in [Lean](dhsorens-lean).
}

